<graph edgedefault="undirected"><node id="&quot;THE PATIENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A 76-year-old male with comorbidities including coronary artery disease, congestive heart failure, type 2 diabetes, hypertension, and peripheral vascular disease, who was hospitalized for a femoral-at bypass graft complication."&lt;SEP&gt;"The individual subject of the hospital record presenting with sepsis, renal failure, and cardiac complications."&lt;SEP&gt;"The individual subject of the medical record who presented with hypotension, acute renal failure, and urosepsis, undergoing resuscitation and medication management."&lt;SEP&gt;"The patient is the subject of the medical record, described as experiencing acute renal failure, myocardial infarction, respiratory distress, and malnutrition prior to discharge."</data>
