</node>
<node id="&quot;COLONOSCOPY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Colonoscopy is a gastrointestinal diagnostic procedure performed in the patient's past, during which diverticulosis was found."&lt;SEP&gt;"This diagnostic procedure was performed on the patient to find diverticulosis."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-87d9cef9bf2900e79467061ad5003a41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01a8df0641b60633d561ef3970a93bd8</data>
