<node id="&quot;STENT IMPLANTATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Stent Implantation refers to the surgeries performed on the patient's heart vessels, including circumflex and anterior descending artery stents."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-01a8df0641b60633d561ef3970a93bd8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BLOOD CULTURES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A diagnostic procedure event where blood was drawn to test for infection, resulting in negative findings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Blood cultures are laboratory tests drawn on admission to identify potential bloodstream infections."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d5608bdb3aa5a25b6c0f796f152462c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01a8df0641b60633d561ef3970a93bd8</data>
