</node>
<node id="&quot;GENERAL MEDICINE SERVICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A hospital service to which the patient was transferred for continued treatment of heart failure and volume overload."&lt;SEP&gt;"A hospital service where the patient was transferred to for continued care following stabilization of volume overload."</data>
