  <data key="d1">"A department providing consultation on antibiotic therapy and management of infection-related symptoms like cellulitis and urosepsis."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specialized medical organization consulted to manage antibiotic regimens and determine medication discontinuation based on culture results."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specialized service that managed antibiotic therapy and infection control for the patient."</data>
