</node>
<node id="&quot;CARDIORESPIRATORY ARREST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A critical life-threatening event occurring in the ICU where the patient stopped breathing and circulation."&lt;SEP&gt;"A critical medical event listed among the patient's discharge diagnoses involving stoppage of heart and breathing."&lt;SEP&gt;"A critical medical event where the patient's heart stopped, requiring epinephrine and cardioversion."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d5608bdb3aa5a25b6c0f796f152462c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87d9cef9bf2900e79467061ad5003a41</data>
